 [["Checked baggage","Not permitted"],["Limit","2 power banks, each max. 100 Wh or 2 g lithium content"],["100 to 160 Wh","Needs Lufthansa's approval, requested via the Help Center at booking"],["Using or charging","Prohibited, except for approved medical devices"],["Medication cooling bags","Not treated as medical devices: they cannot be charged from a power bank"],["Where to store","Under the seat in front, in the seat pocket, on you or in your hand luggage, never the overhead locker"],["Short circuit protection","Original packaging, taped terminals or a separate plastic bag or pouch per power bank"],["Banned model","Mobikins MK-PB-04, on every Lufthansa Group flight"]],
