 [["Checked baggage","Not permitted"],["Limit","2 power banks, each max. 100 Wh or 2 g lithium content"],["100 to 160 Wh","Needs Austrian's approval, requested by email to specialcases@austrian.com at booking"],["Classification","Power banks count as spare batteries, not as electronic devices"],["Using or charging","Prohibited, except for approved medical devices"],["Where to store","Under the seat, in the seat pocket, on you or in hand luggage, not the overhead locker"],["Banned model","Mobikins MK-PB-04, on all Lufthansa Group flights"]],
